## 4. Database Migration Order

To guarantee referential integrity and zero migration deadlocks:

1. **`001_create_users.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.users` table (`id` UUID PK references `auth.users(id)` ON DELETE CASCADE, `username` VARCHAR(30) UNIQUE NOT NULL, `avatar_url` TEXT, `bio` TEXT, `created_at`, `updated_at`).
   - Trigger `on_auth_user_created` to automatically insert into `public.users` on Supabase Auth signup.
2. **`002_create_categories.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.categories` (`id` UUID PK DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(), `name` VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL, `description` TEXT, `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()).
   - Seeds initial 8 categories: Education, Career, Relationships, Family, Finance, Health, Mental Wellbeing, Social Life.
3. **`003_create_experiences.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.experiences` (`id` UUID PK, `author_id` UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `category_id` UUID REFERENCES categories(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT, `title` VARCHAR(150) NOT NULL, `story` TEXT NOT NULL, `is_anonymous` BOOLEAN DEFAULT true, `status` VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'active', `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(), `updated_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()).
   - Indexes on `author_id`, `category_id`, and `created_at DESC`.
4. **`004_create_tags.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.tags` (`id` UUID PK, `name` VARCHAR(50) UNIQUE NOT NULL, `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()).
   - Creates `public.experience_tags` (`experience_id` UUID REFERENCES experiences(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `tag_id` UUID REFERENCES tags(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, PRIMARY KEY (experience_id, tag_id)).
5. **`005_create_comments.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.comments` (`id` UUID PK, `experience_id` UUID REFERENCES experiences(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `author_id` UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `content` TEXT NOT NULL, `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(), `updated_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()).
   - Indexes on `experience_id` and `created_at DESC`.
6. **`006_create_outcomes.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.outcomes` (`id` UUID PK, `experience_id` UUID REFERENCES experiences(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `days_after` INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (days_after IN (30, 90, 180)), `content` TEXT NOT NULL, `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()).
   - Index on `experience_id`.
7. **`007_create_reports.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.reports` (`id` UUID PK, `reporter_id` UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE SET NULL, `experience_id` UUID REFERENCES experiences(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `comment_id` UUID REFERENCES comments(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `reason` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL, `status` VARCHAR(20) DEFAULT 'pending', `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()).
8. **`008_create_bookmarks.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.bookmarks` (`user_id` UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `experience_id` UUID REFERENCES experiences(id) ON DELETE CASCADE, `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(), PRIMARY KEY (user_id, experience_id)).
9. **`009_create_analytics_events.sql`**:
   - Creates `public.analytics_events` (`id` UUID PK DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(), `user_id` UUID REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE SET NULL, `event_name` VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL, `entity_id` UUID, `metadata` JSONB DEFAULT '{}'::jsonb, `created_at` TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()).
10. **`010_enable_rls_and_policies.sql`**:
    - Enables Row Level Security (RLS) on all tables.
    - Profiles: Public SELECT; UPDATE only where `auth.uid() = id`.
    - Experiences: Public SELECT for `status = 'active'`; INSERT where `auth.uid() = author_id`; UPDATE/DELETE only where `auth.uid() = author_id`.
    - Comments: Public SELECT; INSERT where `auth.uid() = author_id`; DELETE only where `auth.uid() = author_id`.
    - Outcomes: Public SELECT; INSERT where `auth.uid() = (SELECT author_id FROM experiences WHERE id = experience_id)`.
    - Bookmarks: SELECT/INSERT/DELETE where `auth.uid() = user_id`.
    - Reports: INSERT for authenticated users; SELECT only for admin/moderator role.

