## Verification Plan

### Automated Checks
- `npm run lint` — ESLint strict verification with no warnings.
- `npx tsc --noEmit` — Strict TypeScript type-check ensuring zero `any` types.
- `npm run build` — Next.js production build verification.

### Manual / Browser Verification
- **Auth Flow**: Register anonymous account -> Set username -> Login -> Logout.
- **Experience Flow**: Create experience -> View in Trending feed -> Filter by Category -> Search by keyword.
- **Outcome Flow**: Add 30-day outcome update -> Verify milestone node in OutcomeTimeline.
- **Comment Flow**: Post comment -> Verify rendered on experience -> Delete own comment.
- **Bookmark Flow**: Bookmark experience -> Check under Profile saved tab -> Remove bookmark.
- **Report Flow**: Submit report -> Verify recorded in `reports` table.
- **Responsive & A11y Audit**: Test in mobile viewport (390x844px iPhone 12/13/14 size) for bottom nav, touch targets, and contrast.
